Are you [[strong]](river, strength = 8) or [[clever]](river, strength = 3)?

[[river]]:
A fallen tree blocks the river.

{{#if strength >= 5}}You could [[lift the tree]](lift).{{else}}It's far too heavy for you to lift.{{/if}}

Or you could [[swim around it]](swim).

[[lift]]:
@end
You heave the tree out of the way, and carry on down the river.

[[swim]]:
@end
You swim around the tree. The water is freezing.
